        "note": "POST /runs, the dashboard Run audit button, a \"run audit\" email or the 06:00 UTC schedule puts one audit job on the queue."
      },
      {
        "id": "audit-inputs",
        "label": "What the audit reads",
        "focus": [
          "portals",
          "voyage",
          "claude",
          "worker",
          "store"
        ],
        "note": "Rules from eight regulators are hashed; only changed rules are embedded, then Claude extracts and assesses obligations against code."
      },
      {
        "id": "audit-outputs",
        "label": "What the audit produces",
        "focus": [
          "worker",
          "store",
          "bucket",
          "alerts",
          "web",
          "dashboard"
        ],
        "note": "Findings and run status go to Postgres, the PDF to Tigris, critical violations to Slack and AgentMail; the dashboard reads via the API."
      }
    ]
